{"ID":7,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2026-08-13 16:16:44","post_date_gmt":"2026-08-13 16:16:44","post_content":"<p>\n<strong style=\"color:#fdc800\">24 DAYS LEFT<\/strong> Before Professional Nursing Program Classes Start<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Healthcare Career Training<\/b> in Miami<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Your Future in Healthcare Starts Here<\/h1>\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Gain the skills, hands-on training, and support<\/strong> you need to take the next step toward a rewarding healthcare career.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>\n.iti{\nwidth: 100% !important;\n}\n.iti__country-container{\nright:auto !important;\n}\n.fusion-form-form-wrapper .fusion-form-field .fusion-form-input-with-icon .fusion-form-input{\npadding-left: 3.5em !important;\n}\n.mechanic-mobile:before{\ndisplay:none !important;\n}\n.iti input.iti__tel-input{\n    padding-left: 3.5em !important\n}\n<\/style>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https:\/\/cdn.jsdelivr.net\/npm\/intl-tel-input@27.0.9\/dist\/css\/intlTelInput.css\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>\n\/* Home form: selector scope fixed 2026-10-16 *\/\n.elementor-7 {\n  --saber-form-ink: #001a39;\n  --saber-form-navy: #082b55;\n  --saber-form-blue: #25377b;\n  --saber-form-yellow: #fdc800;\n  --saber-form-sky: #f3f9ff;\n  --saber-form-border: #b8c8d8;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-group > label {\n  letter-spacing: .01em;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 input.elementor-field:not([type=\"radio\"]),\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 select.elementor-field,\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 textarea.elementor-field {\n  min-height: 48px;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--saber-form-border);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #fff;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 26, 57, .04);\n  transition: border-color .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background-color .18s ease;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 input.elementor-field::placeholder,\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 textarea.elementor-field::placeholder {\n  color: #6d7f90;\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 input.elementor-field:focus,\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 select.elementor-field:focus,\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 textarea.elementor-field:focus {\n  border-color: var(--saber-form-blue);\n  background: #fff;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 55, 123, .13);\n  outline: none;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .iti {\n  width: 100% !important;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .iti input.iti__tel-input {\n  padding-left: 3.75rem !important;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio .elementor-field-subgroup {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: 12px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio .elementor-field-option {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100% !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  border: 0 !important;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio input[type=\"radio\"] {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  margin: 0;\n  opacity: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio input[type=\"radio\"] + label {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 11px;\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 76px;\n  padding: 14px 16px;\n  color: var(--saber-form-ink);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  text-align: left;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--saber-form-border);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 7px rgba(0, 26, 57, .04);\n  transition: border-color .18s ease, background-color .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, transform .18s ease;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio input[type=\"radio\"] + label::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  flex: 0 0 20px;\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 20px;\n  border: 2px solid #8294a7;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #fff;\n  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #fff;\n  transition: border-color .18s ease, background-color .18s ease;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio input[type=\"radio\"] + label:hover {\n  border-color: var(--saber-form-blue);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0, 26, 57, .08);\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio input[type=\"radio\"]:checked + label {\n  color: var(--saber-form-ink);\n  border-color: var(--saber-form-yellow);\n  background: #fff8d8;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(253, 200, 0, .2), 0 8px 18px rgba(0, 26, 57, .08);\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio input[type=\"radio\"]:checked + label::before {\n  border-color: var(--saber-form-blue);\n  background: var(--saber-form-blue);\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio input[type=\"radio\"]:focus-visible + label {\n  outline: 3px solid rgba(37, 55, 123, .25);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-button[type=\"submit\"] {\n  min-height: 52px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(253, 200, 0, .2);\n  transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background-color .18s ease;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-button[type=\"submit\"]:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(8, 43, 85, .18);\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-button[type=\"submit\"]:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid rgba(37, 55, 123, .28);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n.elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-message {\n  margin-top: 7px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n  .elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-group-fname,\n  .elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-group-lname {\n    width: 100% !important;\n  }\n  .elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio .elementor-field-subgroup {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .elementor-7 .elementor-element.elementor-element-b7159a9 .elementor-field-type-radio input[type=\"radio\"] + label {\n    min-height: 60px;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-1024x1024.png 1024w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-768x768.png 768w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse.png 1170w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Healthcare Programs<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M352 96c0-53.02-42.98-96-96-96s-96 42.98-96 96 42.98 96 96 96 96-42.98 96-96zM233.59 241.1c-59.33-36.32-155.43-46.3-203.79-49.05C13.55 191.13 0 203.51 0 219.14v222.8c0 14.33 11.59 26.28 26.49 27.05 43.66 2.29 131.99 10.68 193.04 41.43 9.37 4.72 20.48-1.71 20.48-11.87V252.56c-.01-4.67-2.32-8.95-6.42-11.46zm248.61-49.05c-48.35 2.74-144.46 12.73-203.78 49.05-4.1 2.51-6.41 6.96-6.41 11.63v245.79c0 10.19 11.14 16.63 20.54 11.9 61.04-30.72 149.32-39.11 192.97-41.4 14.9-.78 26.49-12.73 26.49-27.06V219.14c-.01-15.63-13.56-28.01-29.81-27.09z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFull-Time Program\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Associate of Science Degree<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/professional-nursing-program\/\">Professional Nursing Program (A.S.)\n<\/a><\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t<p>SABER College prepares you to work under the direct supervision of a physical therapist, giving you the skills to restore lives and launch your career. Witness New Levels of Perseverance and Will Power.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm0 448c-110.5 0-200-89.5-200-200S145.5 56 256 56s200 89.5 200 200-89.5 200-200 200zm61.8-104.4l-84.9-61.7c-3.1-2.3-4.9-5.9-4.9-9.7V116c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h32c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v141.7l66.8 48.6c5.4 3.9 6.5 11.4 2.6 16.8L334.6 349c-3.9 5.3-11.4 6.5-16.8 2.6z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1,725 clock hours\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-interaction-id=\"a5c8a4a\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"a5c8a4a\" id=\"84\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/185371858.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/185371858.png 200w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/185371858-150x150.png 150w\" alt=\"Commission on Accreditation in Physical Therapy Education - CAPTE\"\/>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Associate of Science Degree<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h3><a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\">Physical Therapist Assistant Program (A.S.)<\/a><\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Do you have a passion for helping others in need? Is it your dream to one day have a career that helps people improve their lives by overcoming physical challenges? If either of these things rings true, you should strongly consider a career in physical therapy and health sciences.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm0 448c-110.5 0-200-89.5-200-200S145.5 56 256 56s200 89.5 200 200-89.5 200-200 200zm61.8-104.4l-84.9-61.7c-3.1-2.3-4.9-5.9-4.9-9.7V116c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h32c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v141.7l66.8 48.6c5.4 3.9 6.5 11.4 2.6 16.8L334.6 349c-3.9 5.3-11.4 6.5-16.8 2.6z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1,785 Clock Hours\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Why Choose SABER?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>There are a lot of reasons why you should choose Saber College.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1350\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1350\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Career Development Services \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our <a href=\"\/student-services\/career-services\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">career services<\/a> help you prepare and apply for those job opportunities to land your dream job faster. Our career coaches are here to help you every step. They\u2019ll give you tips on how to ace an interview, write a resume and cover letter that gets noticed by hiring managers, how to get a job when you have no experience, and more.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1351\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1351\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Highly-Qualified Faculty and Staff \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our talented faculty and staff are dedicated to combining coursework with real-life working knowledge. We want to provide you with an education that prepares you for success. Our instructors are highly qualified and bring real-world experience to the classroom. They work in your industry and have years of experience as managers and leaders. We also offer several internship opportunities that provide valuable hands-on experience.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1352\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1352\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Learning Through Hands-on Instruction \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Saber College offers comprehensive career training and hands-on experience among the programs we offer so that once you graduate, you\u2019re ready to hit the ground running! You\u2019ll experience hands-on instruction in our programs, providing the skills and knowledge to pass your exams and start a successful career. Our instructors have years of experience in their respective fields and are dedicated to providing you with the best training possible to ensure success.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our <a href=\"\/student-services\/career-services\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">career services<\/a> help you prepare and apply for those job opportunities to land your dream job faster. Our career coaches are here to help you every step. They\u2019ll give you tips on how to ace an interview, write a resume and cover letter that gets noticed by hiring managers, how to get a job when you have no experience, and more.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our talented faculty and staff are dedicated to combining coursework with real-life working knowledge. We want to provide you with an education that prepares you for success. Our instructors are highly qualified and bring real-world experience to the classroom. They work in your industry and have years of experience as managers and leaders. We also offer several internship opportunities that provide valuable hands-on experience.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Saber College offers comprehensive career training and hands-on experience among the programs we offer so that once you graduate, you\u2019re ready to hit the ground running! You\u2019ll experience hands-on instruction in our programs, providing the skills and knowledge to pass your exams and start a successful career. Our instructors have years of experience in their respective fields and are dedicated to providing you with the best training possible to ensure success.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Welcome to SABER College<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Leaders in Healthcare Education<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>At <b>SABER College,<\/b> we believe a successful healthcare career begins with a balance of <b>professional training<\/b> and <b>personal growth.<\/b> Our programs in <b>Professional Nursing<\/b> and <b>Physical Therapist Assisting (PTA)<\/b> are built to provide <b>hands-on, career-focused education<\/b> that prepares you for real-world success.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Through our <b>Associate Degree programs,<\/b> you\u2019ll gain the <b>clinical skills, practical experience, and confidence<\/b> needed to excel in today\u2019s healthcare field\u2014 while developing the mindset and motivation to grow both personally and professionally.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  \t<video\n    data-id=\"d01d8ea\" data-interaction-id=\"d01d8ea\"\n    data-e-type=\"e-self-hosted-video\" data-interactions=\"null\"\n    data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"d01d8ea\"\n\t\tclass=\"e-self-hosted-video-base\"\n\t\t\t\tautoplay\t\tmuted\t\tloop\t\t\t\tplaysinline\t\tcontrolslist=\"nodownload\"\t\tpreload=\"metadata\"\n\t>\n\t\t<source src=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/NURSING-IA-VIDEO-1.webm#t=0,21\">\n\t<\/video>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Find your star<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Begin your journey at SABER College\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 22C7.65685 22 9 20.6569 9 19C9 17.3431 7.65685 16 6 16C4.34315 16 3 17.3431 3 19C3 20.6569 4.34315 22 6 22Z\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><path d=\"M9 19H17.5C18.4283 19 19.3185 18.6313 19.9749 17.9749C20.6313 17.3185 21 16.4283 21 15.5C21 14.5717 20.6313 13.6815 19.9749 13.0251C19.3185 12.3687 18.4283 12 17.5 12H6.5C5.57174 12 4.6815 11.6313 4.02513 10.9749C3.36875 10.3185 3 9.42826 3 8.5C3 7.57174 3.36875 6.6815 4.02513 6.02513C4.6815 5.36875 5.57174 5 6.5 5H15\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><path d=\"M18 8C19.6569 8 21 6.65685 21 5C21 3.34315 19.6569 2 18 2C16.3431 2 15 3.34315 15 5C15 6.65685 16.3431 8 18 8Z\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Student First Approach<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t<p>At SABER College, students come first. Our supportive learning environment combines personalized attention, hands-on education, and academic support to help you stay focused and move confidently toward your goals.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M11 17L13 19C13.197 19.197 13.4308 19.3532 13.6882 19.4598C13.9456 19.5665 14.2214 19.6213 14.5 19.6213C14.7786 19.6213 15.0544 19.5665 15.3118 19.4598C15.5692 19.3532 15.803 19.197 16 19C16.197 18.803 16.3532 18.5692 16.4598 18.3118C16.5665 18.0544 16.6213 17.7786 16.6213 17.5C16.6213 17.2214 16.5665 16.9456 16.4598 16.6882C16.3532 16.4308 16.197 16.197 16 16\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><path d=\"M14 14L16.5 16.5C16.8978 16.8978 17.4374 17.1213 18 17.1213C18.5626 17.1213 19.1022 16.8978 19.5 16.5C19.8978 16.1022 20.1213 15.5626 20.1213 15C20.1213 14.4374 19.8978 13.8978 19.5 13.5L15.62 9.62002C15.0575 9.05821 14.295 8.74265 13.5 8.74265C12.705 8.74265 11.9425 9.05821 11.38 9.62002L10.5 10.5C10.1022 10.8978 9.56259 11.1213 8.99998 11.1213C8.43737 11.1213 7.89781 10.8978 7.49998 10.5C7.10216 10.1022 6.87866 9.56262 6.87866 9.00002C6.87866 8.43741 7.10216 7.89784 7.49998 7.50002L10.31 4.69002C11.2222 3.78016 12.4119 3.20057 13.6906 3.04299C14.9694 2.88541 16.2641 3.15885 17.37 3.82002L17.84 4.10002C18.2658 4.357 18.772 4.44613 19.26 4.35002L21 4.00002\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><path d=\"M21 3L22 14H20\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><path d=\"M3 3L2 14L8.5 20.5C8.89782 20.8978 9.43739 21.1213 10 21.1213C10.5626 21.1213 11.1022 20.8978 11.5 20.5C11.8978 20.1022 12.1213 19.5626 12.1213 19C12.1213 18.4374 11.8978 17.8978 11.5 17.5\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><path d=\"M3 4H11\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Your Path to a Healthcare Career Starts Here\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Prepare for a healthcare career through practical, career-focused education. Learn from experienced instructors and build the knowledge and skills you need to take your next step with confidence.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M2 9.50004C2.00002 8.38724 2.33759 7.30062 2.96813 6.3837C3.59867 5.46678 4.49252 4.7627 5.53161 4.36444C6.5707 3.96618 7.70616 3.89248 8.78801 4.15308C9.86987 4.41368 10.8472 4.99632 11.591 5.82404C11.6434 5.88005 11.7067 5.92471 11.7771 5.95524C11.8474 5.98577 11.9233 6.00152 12 6.00152C12.0767 6.00152 12.1526 5.98577 12.2229 5.95524C12.2933 5.92471 12.3566 5.88005 12.409 5.82404C13.1504 4.99094 14.128 4.40341 15.2116 4.13964C16.2952 3.87588 17.4335 3.94839 18.4749 4.34752C19.5163 4.74666 20.4114 5.45349 21.0411 6.37394C21.6708 7.29439 22.0053 8.3848 22 9.50004C22 11.79 20.5 13.5 19 15L13.508 20.313C13.3217 20.527 13.0919 20.699 12.834 20.8173C12.5762 20.9357 12.296 20.9979 12.0123 20.9997C11.7285 21.0015 11.4476 20.9429 11.1883 20.8278C10.9289 20.7127 10.697 20.5437 10.508 20.332L5 15C3.5 13.5 2 11.8 2 9.50004Z\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><path d=\"M3.21997 13H9.49997L9.99997 12L12 16.5L14 9.5L15.5 13H20.77\" stroke=\"#001A39\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Guidance at Every Step\u2014From Enrollment to Graduation<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t<p>You won\u2019t navigate your college journey alone. From enrollment and <a href=\"\/student-services\/academic-affairs\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">academic advising<\/a> to tutoring and graduation, our team is here to provide the guidance and support you need along the way.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Testimonials\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>What Real Students Say!\n<\/h2>\t\t[trustindex no-registration=google]\t\t\t<p>Our Main Highlights\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Achieve Beyond Expectations\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-6180\" open>\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-6180\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Career Outlook For Registered Nurses \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Registered nurses are the backbone of the healthcare industry. With a growing population, increasing rates of chronic conditions, and a greater need for preventative care, the demand for registered nurses will only increase.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>According to the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bls.gov\/ooh\/healthcare\/registered-nurses.htm\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics<\/a>, the median annual wage for registered nurses was <strong>$77,600 in May 2021<\/strong> and is expected to grow.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Over the next decade, registered nurse employment is projected to grow 9 percent from 2020 to 2030, about as fast as the average for all occupations. <strong>About 194,500 openings for registered nurses<\/strong> are projected each year, on average, over the decade. Many of those openings are expected to result from the need to replace workers who transfer to different occupations or exit the labor force, such as retiring.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/professional-nursing-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Click here to learn more about our Professional Nursing Program.<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-6181\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-6181\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Highly-Qualified Faculty and Staff \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you\u2019re interested in a career as a physical therapist assistant, you\u2019re not alone. According to the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bls.gov\/ooh\/healthcare\/physical-therapist-assistants-and-aides.htm\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics Employment Projections<\/a>, employment of PTAs and aides is projected to grow 32 percent from 2020 to 2030, much faster than the average for all occupations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>The median annual wage for physical therapist assistants was <strong>$61,180 in May 2021.<\/strong> These professionals earned an average hourly wage of $29.66 and an average yearly salary of $63,700.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>About 23,800 openings for physical therapists assistants<\/strong> and aides are projected each year, on average, over the decade. Many of those openings are expected to result from the need to replace workers who transfer to different occupations or exit the labor force, such as retiring.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Click here to learn more about our Physical Therapist Assistant Program.<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Registered nurses are the backbone of the healthcare industry. With a growing population, increasing rates of chronic conditions, and a greater need for preventative care, the demand for registered nurses will only increase.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>According to the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bls.gov\/ooh\/healthcare\/registered-nurses.htm\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics<\/a>, the median annual wage for registered nurses was <strong>$77,600 in May 2021<\/strong> and is expected to grow.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Over the next decade, registered nurse employment is projected to grow 9 percent from 2020 to 2030, about as fast as the average for all occupations. <strong>About 194,500 openings for registered nurses<\/strong> are projected each year, on average, over the decade. Many of those openings are expected to result from the need to replace workers who transfer to different occupations or exit the labor force, such as retiring.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/professional-nursing-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Click here to learn more about our Professional Nursing Program.<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you\u2019re interested in a career as a physical therapist assistant, you\u2019re not alone. According to the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bls.gov\/ooh\/healthcare\/physical-therapist-assistants-and-aides.htm\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics Employment Projections<\/a>, employment of PTAs and aides is projected to grow 32 percent from 2020 to 2030, much faster than the average for all occupations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>The median annual wage for physical therapist assistants was <strong>$61,180 in May 2021.<\/strong> These professionals earned an average hourly wage of $29.66 and an average yearly salary of $63,700.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>About 23,800 openings for physical therapists assistants<\/strong> and aides are projected each year, on average, over the decade. Many of those openings are expected to result from the need to replace workers who transfer to different occupations or exit the labor force, such as retiring.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Click here to learn more about our Physical Therapist Assistant Program.<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<img data-interaction-id=\"d83d807\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"d83d807\" id=\"632\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Saber_Nursing_23JunLand_PTA-1.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Saber_Nursing_23JunLand_PTA-1.png 1080w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Saber_Nursing_23JunLand_PTA-1-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Saber_Nursing_23JunLand_PTA-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Saber_Nursing_23JunLand_PTA-1-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Saber_Nursing_23JunLand_PTA-1-768x768.png 768w\" alt=\"\"\/>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Blog Post<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Latest News\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/saber_college_blog\/\" target=\"_self\" data-interaction-id=\"0ad5596\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"0ad5596\">\n\t\tMore Blog SABER\n\t<\/a>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Ready to <br>make a change? <br>Take the first step!<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Requesting information requires no obligation or commitments.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/apply-to-saber-college\/\" target=\"_self\" data-interaction-id=\"1831d5e\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"1831d5e\">\n\t\tApply Now\n\t<\/a>\t\t\t\t\t<img data-interaction-id=\"476065e\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"476065e\" id=\"466\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-banner-call-to-action.png\" width=\"1425\" height=\"906\" srcset=\"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-banner-call-to-action.png 1425w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-banner-call-to-action-300x191.png 300w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-banner-call-to-action-1024x651.png 1024w, http:\/\/localhost:8082\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/sabi-nurse-banner-call-to-action-768x488.png 768w\" alt=\"\"\/>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Stay Connected with SABER<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Follow us on Instagram to see our latest events, <a href=\"\/general\/explore-saber-college-gallery\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">student life<\/a>, and more.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Elfsight Social Feed | Untitled Social Feed -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>FAQs<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>We Have Answers To Your Questions!<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-9380\" open>\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-9380\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Is Financial Aid available for the Physical Therapist Assistant Program? \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes, <a href=\"\/admissions-and-tuition\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Financial Aid<\/a> is available if you qualify.  Our friendly staff is ready to help you.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-9381\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-9381\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Do you have to go to medical school to be a Physical Therapist Assistant (PTA)? \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>You do not have to go to medical school to become a <a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">PTA.<\/a> But you should check that the school you choose is licensed by the State Department of Education and accredited by the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.capteonline.org\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Commission on Accreditation in Physical Therapy Education (CAPTE)<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-9382\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-9382\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Can I become a Physical Therapy Assistant (PTA) right out of high school? \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>You may study to become a <a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">PTA<\/a> right out of high school.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-9383\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-9383\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Why should I choose to become a Physical Therapist Assistant? (PTA) \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Suppose you\u2019re not sure but are looking for something flexible and autonomous. In that case, you should consider the many benefits that a career as a <a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">PTA<\/a> could bring, including that you can help people regain their quality of life.  Also, the Miami-Dade county means average salary for a Physical Therapist Assistant is $67,220, with a mean hourly wage of $32.32. O*NET Online lists <a href=\"https:\/\/www.onetonline.org\/link\/details\/31-2021.00\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Physical Therapist Assistant<\/a> as a job with a Bright Outlook, meaning Bright Outlook occupations are expected to grow rapidly in the next several years. They may have large numbers of job openings or are new and emerging occupations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-9384\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-9384\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t How do I get a Professional Nursing Degree? \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you are attending school in Florida, you must attend a school that is licensed by the Florida Department of Education to offer Associate Degree Programs, specifically Professional Nursing Programs and you should check that the school is licensed by the state\u2019s Board of Nursing.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-9385\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"6\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-9385\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Can I take the NCLEX without a nursing degree? \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>To take the NCLEX-RN, you must be a nursing program graduate.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-9386\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"7\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-9386\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Can I become an RN in 2 years? \n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes, provided you do not fail any courses, you may graduate in 24 months. The 24 months include the general education and core courses required to become a nurse graduate.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes, <a href=\"\/admissions-and-tuition\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Financial Aid<\/a> is available if you qualify.  Our friendly staff is ready to help you.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>You do not have to go to medical school to become a <a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">PTA.<\/a> But you should check that the school you choose is licensed by the State Department of Education and accredited by the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.capteonline.org\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Commission on Accreditation in Physical Therapy Education (CAPTE)<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>You may study to become a <a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">PTA<\/a> right out of high school.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Suppose you\u2019re not sure but are looking for something flexible and autonomous. In that case, you should consider the many benefits that a career as a <a href=\"\/saber_college_programs\/physical-therapist-assistant-program\/\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">PTA<\/a> could bring, including that you can help people regain their quality of life.  Also, the Miami-Dade county means average salary for a Physical Therapist Assistant is $67,220, with a mean hourly wage of $32.32. O*NET Online lists <a href=\"https:\/\/www.onetonline.org\/link\/details\/31-2021.00\" style=\"color:#0070E0;text-decoration:underline\">Physical Therapist Assistant<\/a> as a job with a Bright Outlook, meaning Bright Outlook occupations are expected to grow rapidly in the next several years. They may have large numbers of job openings or are new and emerging occupations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you are attending school in Florida, you must attend a school that is licensed by the Florida Department of Education to offer Associate Degree Programs, specifically Professional Nursing Programs and you should check that the school is licensed by the state\u2019s Board of Nursing.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>To take the NCLEX-RN, you must be a nursing program graduate.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes, provided you do not fail any courses, you may graduate in 24 months. The 24 months include the general education and core courses required to become a nurse graduate.<\/p>","post_title":"Home","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"home","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2026-10-16 13:29:26","post_modified_gmt":"2026-10-16 13:29:26","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/?page_id=7","menu_order":0,"post_type":"page","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","url":"http:\/\/localhost:8082\/"}
